    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1175">

                <pb facs="1259" n="1163" xml:id="pg1163"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. von Holleben to Mr. Day.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Imperial German Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-07-20"><hi rendition="#italic">July 20,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Secretary of State</hi>: I have the honor to
                    acknowledge your excellency’s favor of the 15th instant relative to the entrance
                    of neutral warships into, and their departure from, a blockaded port, and to
                    state that I have informed my Government of its contents.</p>
                <p>I avail myself of this occasion to renew to you, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Holleben.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
